# RustOS Apps catalog. One app per line, fields separated by |
#   category | id | label | pacman packages | flatpak ids | services to enable | flags
# Use - for "none". Flags (comma separated): on = ticked at first, x86 = only offered on PCs/Intel/AMD
# (hidden on the ARM edition), ui = handled by the picker itself (no packages here).
# Package names that do not exist in the repositories are skipped at install time, so one wrong name
# can never break an install. Adding an app = adding a line here.
Office and study|office|LibreOffice: documents, spreadsheets, slides|libreoffice-fresh|-|-|on
Office and study|onlyoffice|ONLYOFFICE: Microsoft-style Office look (Flatpak)|-|org.onlyoffice.desktopeditors|-|-
